+From 8595341f07e067dcfe64b753f1daa36b7aaeb2be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Mieczyslaw Nalewaj <namiltd@yahoo.com>
+Date: Sat, 13 Jun 2026 00:19:37 +0200
+Subject: [PATCH 1/6] realtek: detect RTL8367S-VB
+
+Detect RTL8367S-VB and set family.
+
+Signed-off-by: Mieczyslaw Nalewaj <namiltd@yahoo.com>
+---
